{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "07c2c274-4c87-4eb7-9bcb-dee8c24aaf74",
    "name": "COMP3613_A2",
    "description": "Exactly 12 visible requests. Requests 08-12 are repeatable using fresh test fixtures created automatically by the local-only /api/_a2/fixture-bookings helper. Preconditions: install a2_test_fixtures.py and enable helper ONLY with A2_ENABLE_POSTMAN_FIXTURES=1, ENV=development and a local SQLite DATABASE_URI. Never enable fixtures against a public or production database. Set collection variables studentUsername, studentPassword, landlordUsername, landlordPassword; disable automatic redirects on both login requests. Run the collection in order. Run 01 resets transient IDs/tokens only, not credentials. Request 08 makes a background fixture call that does not add a 13th visible request. New fixture listings/bookings persist in the local database each run.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "52604923"
  },
